sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Alice (analyst)
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant RS as Report Service
    participant IS as Incident Service
    participant DB as SQLite
    User->>GW: POST /incidents/101/reports (user JWT)
    GW->>GW: Verify user JWT and issue scoped grants
    GW->>RS: POST /internal/generate (report job + case grants)
    RS->>RS: Verify job and matching case grants
    RS->>IS: GET /internal/incidents/101 (case-101 read grant)
    IS->>IS: Verify signature, scope, audience and identity
    IS->>DB: Load incident 101 and owner
    DB-->>IS: owner = Alice
    IS-->>RS: Authorized incident data
    RS->>RS: Format via installed helper package
    RS->>IS: POST /internal/incidents/101/reports (case-101 report:create grant)
    IS->>DB: Recheck owner and persist report
    DB-->>IS: report 501
    IS-->>RS: report 501
    RS-->>GW: Authorized report summary and content
    GW-->>User: 201 report 501
    Note over User,DB: If incident 102 belongs to Bob, Incident Service denies at owner check
